## Firestore Rules

Review existing:

```
videos/{videoId}
```

rules.

Ensure:

* Users can create their own video documents.
* Users can update only their own unpublished documents.
* Users cannot modify moderation state after submission.
* Cloud Functions remain responsible for:

  * `pending_moderation`
